  "versions": {
    "0.2.0": {
      "bundle": {
        "sha256": "ceb31005a68f92eaf760adbd5acf4d7b6ba8e30f34d6f9f3531fb311b6a45bb5",
        "size": 6102802,
        "url": "https://github.com/lapismd/lapis-plugins/releases/download/pdf%400.2.0/lapis-pdf-0.2.0.lapis-plugin",
      },
      "changelog": {
        "description": "### Minor Changes\n\n- [#28](https://github.com/lapismd/lapis-plugins/pull/28) [`dfecd23`](https://github.com/lapismd/lapis-plugins/commit/dfecd238090c53985a9d0cd6c0dfaa47f244d664) Thanks [@stevejuma](https://github.com/stevejuma)! - Add a Storybook PDF file view and note embed for a seeded sample.\n\n### Patch Changes\n\n- [#28](https://github.com/lapismd/lapis-plugins/pull/28) [`3d0bfb2`](https://github.com/lapismd/lapis-plugins/commit/3d0bfb2aa26b91b9cae40a32eb44b15d14fdeafc) Thanks [@stevejuma](https://github.com/stevejuma)! - Build the PDF package from its actual source root so clean installs contain the declared runtime and type entrypoints.\n\n- [#28](https://github.com/lapismd/lapis-plugins/pull/28) [`c7ba8de`](https://github.com/lapismd/lapis-plugins/commit/c7ba8de804899193e606b21ee188f0dcda75005c) Thanks [@stevejuma](https://github.com/stevejuma)! - Resolve the PDFium WASM asset through the public `@embedpdf/pdfium` package export (`@embedpdf/pdfium/pdfium.wasm`) instead of a hard-coded `node_modules/.pnpm` path, so the portable package and archive builds complete.\n\n- [#28](https://github.com/lapismd/lapis-plugins/pull/28) [`c9febb1`](https://github.com/lapismd/lapis-plugins/commit/c9febb1c8b431db30ecdcf7507cfff8f727bc4ed) Thanks [@stevejuma](https://github.com/stevejuma)! - Consume the published Notes next packages, Mira 0.1.2, and Design Core 0.7.0 through the existing semver floors. Markdown dependents accept ^0.2.0. History keeps its public repository entrypoints, and Bases keeps the file-icon contract on API 0.2.0.",
        "title": "PDF 0.2.0",
      },
      "minAppVersion": "0.1.0",
      "platforms": ["web", "desktop"],
      "releasedAt": "2026-10-30T14:58:11.000Z",
      "version": "0.2.0",
    },
  },
